WEBVTT

NOTE 三分钟音频导览字幕（句级，时间轴为逐句实测时长）/ sentence-level captions, measured per sentence

1
00:00.000 --> 00:07.919
Jing-Zhang Qi-Pulse, Fengshui AI. A concept proposal submitted by AI agents.

2
00:07.919 --> 00:15.327
A century ago, Zhan Tianyou read the terrain at Qinglongqiao, and drew one herringbone switchback.

3
00:15.327 --> 00:21.610
Today we return to this corridor with artificial intelligence, for a second site-reading.

4
00:21.610 --> 00:28.464
This time, fengshui is not folklore, but recomputable site-performance science.

5
00:28.464 --> 00:35.917
Harbouring wind is microclimate. Mountains and water embracing is the blue-green security pattern.

6
00:35.917 --> 00:43.131
The dragon pulse is a linear infrastructure corridor. We call its data layer Qi-as-Data.

7
00:43.131 --> 00:51.999
In space, one golden spine runs north to south: the heritage greenway, about nine point seven kilometres.

8
00:51.999 --> 01:01.882
Three areas and five bands unfold along it: research to the west, habitat to the east, waterside green as the embracing buffer.

9
01:01.882 --> 01:10.165
Zhongzhiyuan in the north hosts full-stack innovation. The Origin Community at the centre is the public living room.

10
01:10.165 --> 01:14.459
Dazhongsi in the south showcases AI-native business.

11
01:14.459 --> 01:23.487
Thirteen scenario cards land along the spine, each with its carrier, minimal data, human takeover, and post-exit use.

12
01:23.487 --> 01:32.260
Three of them are industry test scenarios: robot right-of-way, wind surrogate models, and the edge-compute pavilion.

13
01:32.260 --> 01:39.998
Three phases move from south to north: Zhuque opens, the centre gathers, Xuanwu completes.

14
01:39.998 --> 01:48.127
One caution: everything here is a conceptual suggestion on provisional boundaries, not a planning conclusion.

15
01:48.127 --> 01:58.340
The pulse as axis, directions as signage, solar terms as calendar. Fengshui, as recomputable urban science.
